David Damerell wrote:
> All NetHack characters can make effective use of melee. Your odds of
> getting longsword unrestricted via sacrifice or crowning are good.

(some spoilers below)

Not crowning. Since he's a wizard, he'll get +finger of death unless
he has it in inventory already.  Still a chance for sacrifice gifts,
but since he's neutral and firebrand already exists, there are only
three left he can get that way.

And since a number of artifacts have already been generated and he's
guaranteed to get Magicbane as his first sacrifice gift, the chances
of getting one of the longswords before the odds for getting an
artifact get prohibitive aren't especially great.  With enough alter
camping it's still possible, but probably not worth it for a wizard.

If he absolutely wants to unrestrict longsword, the easiest way to
do it is to write +finger of death himself, then carry it with him
while sacrificing.  Then he'll get vorpal instead when he's crowned.


